# Example configuration. These are placeholder names only, never real secrets.
#
# The interactive translator (interactive_translator.py) does not read this file.
# It asks for your API key at run time with getpass and never saves it.
#
# The optional evaluation scripts read CICERO_API_KEY from the environment if it
# is set; otherwise they also prompt with getpass. Copy this file to .env only if
# your own shell or tooling loads it, and replace the value with your real key.

CICERO_API_KEY=your-provider-api-key-here
